%% Lifecycle of one follow-up work item (one ledger row).
%% Done is decided by evidence from the real system, never by the agent that did the work.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Proposed: Orchestrator extracts a commitment
  Proposed --> Approved: Tier A (auto)
  Proposed --> AwaitingApproval: Tier B
  Proposed --> Cancelled: Tier C recorded for human only, or rejected
  AwaitingApproval --> Approved: advisor approves
  AwaitingApproval --> Cancelled: advisor rejects
  AwaitingApproval --> Blocked: no reply past SLA
  Approved --> InProgress: specialist agent executes
  InProgress --> Done: Verifier confirms evidence in the real system
  InProgress --> Blocked: tool failure, or owner idle past SLA
  Blocked --> InProgress: unblocked after escalation
  Blocked --> Cancelled: meeting passed, or advisor cancels
  Done --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
